{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "2469af65d401d11ce4407481351954dcfd2734d0669a745111461b4fa7762863", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さんっ。\nちょうどいいところに！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n你来得正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "f13b720a69f199bde0d3955b8303f76e3752684d96c4d4fc6e2dd71097c5eee8", "ja": "せっかくですから、{$P$}さんも\n肉球ぷにぷにしていきませんか？", "zh": "难得的好机会，{$P$}先生\n要不要也来捏肉球呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ec21098c21e489992c03d858fbafc96b7d5e73b023fb38594b305a26327baac1", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。\nちなみに、肉球ぷにぷにとはいったい……？", "zh": "辛苦你了，青羽小姐。\n话说，捏肉球是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "ab46200ea80688003ae32060084d12c45809788d3554cb5855144628e3dd3415", "ja": "屋上でこぶんちゃんが寝てるんです。\nとってもかわいくて、気持ちいいんですよ～♪", "zh": "小弟正在屋顶上睡觉呢。\n非常可爱，摸起来很舒服喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "d23f3bd4f41f55a500d4df7fbd93fb1dd153279d3483c63d94bfcdd8375afc2e", "ja": "あ、それと社長さんが\n{$P$}さんを呼んでました！", "zh": "啊，还有社长在找{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0b4fcb8ce25b110d36101a172c011b49ab934b01646b9255a1053592405e1bcf", "ja": "社長が？　なるほど、わかりました……。\nとりあえず屋上に急ぎます！", "zh": "社长吗？原来如此，我明白了……\n那我立刻上屋顶去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "69aae212ed6f52c4a5b02a9b2f59686ca84a5a15bc1d093f3113de4e4c87a701", "ja": "はーい！　いってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好的～！请慢走～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1007_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1da07fb586775d9d228d20d2cb63849613a67b7ab2ed1e74070fbee9d666d49e", "ja": "おはようございます。\nあれ？　音無さん、何を熱心に読んでるんですか？", "zh": "早安。\n咦？音无小姐，什么书让你看得那么专心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "bbc6d07b37543ac67d897a59414ff5127265cd6520d41faeb49def083fa4ed49", "ja": "あ、星占いの本をちょっと……。\nなかなかあたるんですよ、これが♪", "zh": "啊，只是稍微翻翻星座占卜的书……\n这本书还挺准的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "756ddf3c5d49edf697924172e71ecd179bdf56b4856edcf72ffa1f499021f314", "ja": "へえ、面白そうですね。\n今週の俺は、どんな運勢なんでしょう？", "zh": "哦，听起来很有趣。\n那么这星期我的运势如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "f2976c7bfda645dd117e7f1cec005c7b6e59d7dc2a12043024c8ce691f5633a3", "ja": "ちょっと調べてみますね！　えーっと、\n{$P$}さんの運勢は……。", "zh": "等我查一下喔！\n我看看，{$P$}先生的运势是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "1af0d5f782baa9c3f5dc0acabb2d6483332063d0828890f25f1892ebe164ef0d", "ja": "な、なんと！　これは……！", "zh": "居、居然！这是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cebea936d23663eeb3ce4c9f9fce615ac9532d17ceb83ee201114214165bff9c", "ja": "ど、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "怎、怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "9d3d46e6b5e74d8e50fffa0dbbb14f983cb5a8e376cc2b73917256cb69860d76", "ja": "その……{$P$}さんには、\n近々、素敵な出会いがあるそうです！", "zh": "那个……看来{$P$}先生最近，\n会有一场美妙的邂逅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "ec876fb74c4a8141ee2cc5c0ae17dfa1faff1ff6dbb62188a299fd02125377ce", "ja": "しかも、身近な事務員との恋の予感……！\nそれって、それって……もしかして！？", "zh": "而且，有和身边的事务员坠入爱河的预感……！\n这意思、这意思……难道是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "bd61f7c6519d01fac13b7dd7bbf3834121c7c2a44d9fefcc42886de79733a11c", "ja": "デスクワークか……。\nははは、俺達とは無縁の世界ですね！", "zh": "文书工作的人啊……\n哈哈哈，跟我们毫无缘份的世界呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "eb21a73a9a377b9874d1436547d6861122f306eb409f23f2a31176925966720e", "ja": "ピヨッ！？", "zh": "啾！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "03f1a0b6846cd8c8e60e3444a382ace1551f6a20e61d2f6ca442a5e3c03588f4", "ja": "どうかしたのかね、音無君？", "zh": "怎么了吗，音无？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "b8dc2f74d8988ce57dfe2cb8f1f8342c228eb7c8643b4e3410110ff4285a5a1c", "ja": "い、いえ、なんでもないです社長……！\n{$P$}さん、詳しくは後ほど～！", "zh": "没、没事，社长我没什么事……！\n{$P$}先生，详细的之后再说～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5e0d515e55d20adb3c9ca068ab60689725111e77ec328b20953f804cdfc020f0", "ja": "詳しく……？", "zh": "详细的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "8a590c8b18572aa9945eb7eae19e7e5ea43b76a8d7469dbd5f10480c61ce5152", "ja": "よろしい、では本題に入るとしよう！\n君が提出してくれた企画書、読ませてもらったよ。", "zh": "那就好，那么我们进入正题吧！\n我已经看过你提出的企划书了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "09bf1b3093791ba2023791059ee13bf9c6e905dd4b2b7ad679f1adfab3bf2baa", "ja": "天体をモチーフにした公演とは、\n面白い事を考えるものだね！　とても気に入ったよ！", "zh": "以天体为概念的公演，\n你想了个很有趣的企划呢！我很中意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "00457dce7c7d5125eaf8e0c1cec307187a60d8d03b948a220569b8fe35b36a53", "ja": "おお、ありがとうございます！\nでは、企画を進めても……？", "zh": "太好了，谢谢社长赏识！\n那么，企划可以着手进行了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "eb810f176d59f816fabd8318acb17974d420e90bd5ef834654f70b0c3dd039d1", "ja": "もちろんいいとも！　第一弾は太陽をテーマにした\n公演、『Sunshine Rhythm!』だったね。", "zh": "当然没问题！第一波是以太阳为主题的公演，\n『Sunshine Rhythm!』对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "e005548547e9310cc995ef3d47c84d4fed8611b97ca2949a74b4af7953a4909e", "ja": "その名の通り、太陽のように\nあたたかいライブを期待しているよ！", "zh": "期待能看到一场名副其实，\n像太阳一样温暖的演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_1026", "source_sha256": "a6536599ceb763c26c3c0c8d1475141bd6e072aec2e452837edf417e39d8e7e0", "ja": "任せてください", "zh": "请交给我", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "57f0b51c4408fcf7952922d8593e13f2a4556d7240887992de5fddde740ea41a", "ja": "任せてください！　アイドル達と一緒に、きっと\nファンのみんなの心をぽかぽかにしてみせます！", "zh": "请交给我吧！我一定会和偶像们一起，\n让粉丝们的心变得暖洋洋一片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "7f6bd20e3219f5e60a56800999cfd2db4b1a8b91a718e23bdd2afd912ff12ab0", "ja": "ああ。君達なら、必ずやり遂げてくれるだろう！", "zh": "嗯，想必你们能达成目标！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "1012dc59978bc84fc36fdd760d96c4e48c6ae994234134f593fd61b126082e28", "ja": "おっほん！　なにかあったら、いつも気軽に相談して\nくださいね、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "咳咳！要是有需要帮忙的地方，\n尽管随时找我商量喔，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "3a0aeabba72b74827ef655f9be7f87bb05817adfd3639bbdea5e9321e96c8705", "ja": "身近にいる、事務員の、私に！", "zh": "找你身边的事务员，也就是我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "dd7c0630ab7b3097f492bfc9717880df22b2ab9ced42b15328ee99a70bba0215", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　では、さっそく\nプロジェクトをスタートさせますね！", "zh": "非常谢谢你！\n那么我就赶紧开始着手进行专案了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "49a535c30b3c3d1c8f2e5a6d51243cc36826f7cc677305378e67d8aae1fb96a7", "ja": "（さあ、『Sunshine Rhythm!』公演に向けて、\n忙しくなるぞ！　成功するよう、全力を尽くそう！）", "zh": "（好，为了『Sunshine Rhythm!』公演，\n要开始忙碌了！全力追求成功吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
